[Music]  senior team of the year sponsored by  Devon FA Ashmore hockey club Ashmore  hockey club's great season ended  fantastically when they won the men's  team of the Year award from England  hockey for their performances as a club  the team began in the bottom tier in  2003 but won the championship last year  and for the first time in their history  had been promoted to the top tier of the  regional outdoor league it's been a  truly amazing season for their first  team and to capital Sam Taylor who came  through the club's junior ranks has been  picked for the England under 18 boys  squad and Alfie Finney a national junior  who started with the club at its  inception in 2003 as an 8 year old  recently represented Wales at the Gold  Coast 2018 Commonwealth Games Buckland  Athletic FC ladies first team having  only formed three years ago  Buckland Athletic ladies have secured  three consecutive league titles to get  promoted into the FA Women's National  League a fantastic achievement for a  team from the local area last season saw  Buckland win all 22 games scoring 132  goals and only conceding seven on their  way to dominating the league on top of  this they reached the FA Cup second  round defeating teams two leagues above  the fantastic achievements are down to  the hard work and dedication of everyone  at the club with the aim to continue the  success and progression both on and off  the pitch  decoy BMX club for only the second time  in their history decoy BMX club has  finished top of the regional race Series  standings decoy took the lead after  round 2 and have maintained it right  through to the end seeing off the likes  of city based clubs such as Exeter  Bristol and buff the club is also  standing at very proud 15th out of 61 in  the National standings the highest  ranked club from the southwest region  decoy continues year-on-year to grow in  both its size and success with the club  taking largest number of riders in the  southwest region to the British  Championships the club also had four  qualifying riders make the trip over to  Azerbaijan this year to represent Team  GB at the world championships  [Music]  you

